        { "id": "right", "label": "right", "direction": "output", "dataType": "value", "angle": 0 }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "title": "Smoke Procedure",
        "markdown": "# Semantic Zoom Procedure\n\nUse browse mode on `dev.twilite.zone`.\n\n1. Above 50%, confirm authored cards or detail views.\n2. Between 25% and 50%, confirm icon views.\n3. Between 12.5% and 25%, confirm native glyph badges.\n4. At or below 12.5%, confirm native dots.\n5. Click one node, then use the viewport chip; it must center that node at zoom 1.\n6. Keep the node focused while zooming out; it must remain readable while surrounding nodes simplify.\n7. Confirm a node without a requested authored view simplifies rather than expanding into a richer fallback.\n8. Confirm a single click selects and focuses at every level; navigation requires an explicit Open action."
      }
    },
